I had same issue from today (bugreport d8da664a-8543-4bb6-87c5-482a50240722).

It was caused by wrong URL in c:\Program Files\Mozilla Firefox\mozilla.cfg" 

lockPref("autoadmin.global_config_url", "http://internal-server/invalid-url/firefox.js");

@participant1, could you try to capture a [http log](https://firefox-source-docs.mozilla.org/networking/http/logging.html#http-logging)?
I know it's a crash, but a http log is also really helpful for us to debug this. Please select `logging to a file` and send the file to <email-scrubbed>.
Thanks.
